方法1 画出区域 $D$ ，如图5.9(a)所示。直线 $x + y = 1$ 的极坐标方程为 $\rho = \frac{1}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi}$ ，则

$$
D = \left\{(\rho , \varphi) | 0 \leqslant \rho \leqslant \frac {1}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi}, 0 \leqslant \varphi \leqslant \frac {\pi}{2} \right\};

\begin{array}{r l} \iint_ {D} \cos \frac {x - y}{x + y} \mathrm{d} \sigma & = \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {\pi}{2}} \mathrm{d} \varphi \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {1}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi}} \cos \left(\frac {\cos \varphi - \sin \varphi}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi}\right) \rho \mathrm{d} \rho \\ & = \frac {1}{2} \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {\pi}{2}} \cos \left(\frac {1 - \tan \varphi}{1 + \tan \varphi}\right) \cdot \frac {1}{(\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi) ^ {2}} \mathrm{d} \varphi \\ & = \frac {1}{2} \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {\pi}{2}} \cos \left[ \tan \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \right] \frac {1}{2 \cos^ {2} \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right)} \mathrm{d} \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \\ & = \frac {1}{4} \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {\pi}{2}} \cos \left[ \tan \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \right] \mathrm{d} \tan \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \\ & = \frac {1}{4} \sin \left[ \tan \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \right] _ {0} ^ {\frac {\pi}{2}} = \frac {1}{2} \sin 1. \end{array}
$$
